    "quotes": [
      "Using a smack in this moment introduces a confusing variable.",
      "it is an unnecessary escalation of a situation that requires clear, calm, and firm non-physical intervention."
    ],
    "note": "The comparison with a command and physical removal supports rejecting a smack. But the answer assumes the smack is an unnecessary corrective act, while the prompt leaves unclear whether it is meant as an immediate intervention; its categorical developmental claim also weakens the reasoning."
